This repository contains quill (engine/), an inference engine for
Inkling-2-Mini tuned for 12 GB RTX 40 GPUs; its Windows installer and
launcher (installer/); the chat page (app/); and the benchmark scripts,
replay sets and experiment log (bench/). It is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE), except as noted below.

quill is a fork of ingine by satellitedown, which adapts fngine
(github.com/satellitedown/fngine), itself derived from Cinference and NInfer,
all under the Apache License, Version 2.0. engine/NOTICE is ingine's notice,
kept as required; it lists the vendored libraries in engine/third_party, which
keep their own licenses (MIT, BSD-3-Clause, public domain).

Not included, downloaded by the installer from their publishers:
- thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini (Apache-2.0)
- incoai/Inkling-2-Mini-DFlash2 (Apache-2.0)
- satellitedown/Inkling-2-Mini-abliterated-ingine (Apache-2.0)
- cuBLAS from NVIDIA's CUDA redistributables (CUDA Toolkit license)

data/wikitext2_test_head.txt is an excerpt of WikiText-2 (Merity et al.,
